# T31 - bonus: SAVE then LOAD restores the saved state
PROGRAM 20 3 5.00 12 0
COURSE C1 REGULAR 4 CORE -
COURSE TH THESIS 6 CORE C1
STUDENT R1 Asha
REGISTER R1 C1 1
GRADE R1 C1 1 B
REGISTER R1 TH 2
GRADE R1 TH 2 S
SAVE t31.sav
STUDENT R2 Ben
CONVERT R1 TH F
GPA R1
LOAD t31.sav
GPA R2
GPA R1
CONVERT R1 TH A
GPA R1
TRANSCRIPT R1
LOAD t31-missing.sav
LOAD
SAVE
SAVE /no/such/dir/x.sav
GPA R1
